{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53171","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 许兰","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道高心转实，德重意唯坚。\n不惧洪波远，中华访法缘。\n精勤同忍可，广学等弥天。\n归到扶桑国，迎人拥海壖。\n（日本甲本注：「壖，应作烟。\n」同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许兰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}